'''Jigsaw''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 5]] or through trading.  

== Appearance ==
Its blade is made out of a colorful jigsaw puzzle, hence the name. The guard and handle are solid black.

